<%--
Ip_Address_Display - an IP address, with where it is beneath it when that is known

$ip_address - the address (null renders <Empty_Value />)
$location   - the server's Rsx_Geo_Ip::label() for it ("City, State, USA", or a listed
              network's name such as "AWS"), shipped beside the address as
              ip_address__location; null shows the address alone

The location is resolved by the endpoint on every load and never stored (rsx:man geo_ip).
A screen region that shows one carries <Geo_Ip_Credit /> once - the attribution DB-IP's
licence requires.

Usage:
    <td><Ip_Address_Display $ip_address=session.ip_address $location=session.ip_address__location /></td>
--%>
<Define:Ip_Address_Display tag="span">
    <% if (this.args.ip_address) { %>
        <span class="Ip_Address_Display__address"><%= this.args.ip_address %></span>
        <% if (this.args.location) { %>
            <span class="Ip_Address_Display__location"><%= this.args.location %></span>
        <% } %>
    <% } else { %>
        <Empty_Value />
    <% } %>
</Define:Ip_Address_Display>
